<title>MALAYSIA: TABLE-Bandar Raya 6-mth net up 3 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Bandar Raya 6-mth net up 3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  65.17   vs	  63.13</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 18.0    vs	  20.8</p>
<p>    Turnover		   231.64   vs	 190.21</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    88.67   vs	  87.40</p>
<p>    Minorities	   add   0.52   vs  less   8.86</p>
<p>NOTE - Bandar Raya Development Bhd is engaged in property development, investment and management.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
